
=== 1. Download real HLA-DRB1 haplotypes (12 GRCh38 sequences, pggb test data) ===
    12 haplotypes

=== 2. Designate GRCh38 (haplotype 0) as the shared reference; split the rest ===
    reference GRCh38 (11068 bp) + 11 haplotypes

=== 3. Call variants per haplotype (minimap2 align -> paftools call) ===
    hap0: 672 variants
    hap1: 890 variants
    hap2: 891 variants
    hap3: 672 variants
    hap4: 882 variants
    hap5: 672 variants

=== 4. Merge into two population VCFs (A = haps 0,2,4 ; B = haps 1,3,5) ===
    popA: 1475 variant sites
    popB: 1238 variant sites

=== 5. Build acyclic, base-level pangenome graphs (vg construct) ===
    cg_A: nodes	4500 edges	6383  acyclic
    cg_B: nodes	3742 edges	5240  acyclic

